  "description": "Vectrex video game console. Direct from 1982.\nModel created in Modo 14. Materials setup for Modo and Blender.\n\n**BEWARE, the backside isn't modeled.**\n\nFile formats :\n\n- .lxo (modo 14)\n- .dae\n- .blend (Blender 2.83)\n- .obj\n- .fbx (2018) \n\nThe Vectrex is a vector display-based home video game console–the only one ever designed and released for the home market, developed by Smith Engineering. It was first released for the North America market in November 1982",
